      en: ["Founded around the year 1688.", "Home to the INIFAT agricultural research institute.", "Birthplace of writer Italo Calvino in 1923.", "Located in the Boyeros district of Havana Province.", "Near the important pilgrimage site of El Rincón.", "Situated in close proximity to José Martí Airport."],
