      en: ["The municipality covers an area of approximately 563 square kilometers.", "The sugar mill was founded in 1913 under the name Elia Sugar Company.", "The current name 'Colombia' was officially adopted after 1959.", "The town is situated at an average elevation of 45 meters above sea level.", "The region features an extensive narrow-gauge railway network for sugarcane transport.", "Colombia borders the municipality of Guáimaro in Camagüey province to the north."],
