      en: ["The region is a leading producer of rice in Cuba.", "The San Diego de los Baños spa is located in this municipality.", "Los Palacios was founded in the year 1760.", "The A4 highway passes directly by the town.", "Tobacco is primarily cultivated in the higher elevation areas.", "The municipality includes part of the Sierra del Rosario reserve."],
      es: [],
