      en: ["Batabanó was officially founded on February 5, 1688.", "The town was the global epicenter of the sponge industry during the 20th century.", "Surgidero de Batabanó is the main terminal for ferries to the Isle of Youth.", "The municipality covers a land area of approximately 187 square kilometers.", "The coastline is lined with extensive mangrove forests.", "The railway connection to Havana was completed as early as 1843."],
      es: [],
