      en: ["Maisí contains the easternmost point of the island of Cuba (Punta de Maisí).", "The La Concha lighthouse was first put into service in 1862.", "The area features world-class examples of elevated marine terraces.", "Coffee production is the primary economic activity of the municipality.", "The shortest distance across the sea to Haiti is only about 77 km.", "The municipality covers an area of approximately 525 square kilometers."],
